===Loki's Arrival===
[[File:Loki in the ground credits scene.png|{{AltFloat}}|[[Loki/New York Time Heist|Loki]] wakes up]]
{{Quote|This is the Void. That's [[Alioth]]. And [[Kid Loki's Crew|we]]'re his lunch. Come on!|[[Classic Loki]] to [[Loki/New York Time Heist|Loki]]|Journey Into Mystery}}
Having been pruned, [[Loki/New York Time Heist|Loki]] woke up in the Void and discovered four versions of himself. He followed them back to the [[Loki Palace]] where Loki tried to come up with a plan to escape.<ref name="LK104">''[[The Nexus Event|Loki: 1.04: The Nexus Event]]''</ref>
[[File:Sylvie Enchants Alioth.png|{{AltFloat}}|[[Sylvie Laufeydottir]] discovers she can enchant [[Alioth]]]]
Later on, [[Sylvie Laufeydottir]] awakened, having pruned herself. She found herself in front of [[Alioth]] and was forced to run away. As Alioth got close, she touched it and was able to catch a glimpse of the [[Citadel at the End of Time]]. She kept running for her life and eventually found [[Mobius M. Mobius]], who had been pruned earlier. The two drove away to find Loki.<ref name="LK105"/>

===[[Ambush at the Loki Palace]]===
[[File:Loki105 0394.jpg|{{AltFloat}}|[[Kid Loki's Crew]] talk]]
{{Quote|Surely there's something to do."<br>"There is. Survive. That's all there is. All there ever was.|[[Loki/New York Time Heist|Loki]] and [[Classic Loki]]|Journey Into Mystery}}
As the [[Kid Loki's Crew|Lokis]] talked about their past, [[Loki/New York Time Heist|Loki]] argued that [[Alioth]] could be killed and prepared to go outside of the [[Loki Palace]]. However, as he was about to leave, he was confronted by another group of Lokis led by [[President Loki]]. As President Loki confronted [[Kid Loki]] about ruling the Void, [[Boastful Loki]] revealed that he was working with President Loki in order to claim the throne, though President Loki betrayed him. 
[[File:Loki Stills 47.jpg|{{AltFloat}}|Many Loki Variants fight each other]]
In a turn of events, President Loki was betrayed by his own army and wondered why [[Alligator Loki]] was there. Alligator Loki chewed off President Loki's arm as the Lokis began fighting each other. Loki, Kid Loki, Classic Loki, and Alligator Loki managed to escape the Palace as the other Lokis agreed to help Loki. Eventually, [[Sylvie Laufeydottir]] and [[Mobius M. Mobius]] caught up with them.<ref name="LK105">''[[Journey Into Mystery|Loki: 1.05: Journey Into Mystery]]''</ref>

===Reunion at the End of Time===
[[File:Journey Into Mystery 05.png|{{AltFloat}}|[[Loki/New York Time Heist|Loki]] bonds with [[Sylvie Laufeydottir]]]]
{{Quote|When [[Alioth|it]] hit me earlier, I linked to it. It was brief, but I caught a glimpse of something, and I think if I can get close enough to it, I can enchant it, and it's gonna take me to whoever's behind all of this.|[[Sylvie Laufeydottir]]|Journey Into Mystery}}
While [[Loki/New York Time Heist|Loki]] explained his plan to [[Sylvie Laufeydottir]], Sylvie argued that Loki's plan could not work and that they should enchant [[Alioth]] instead. The group made refuge in a fallen structure as [[Mobius M. Mobius]] reminisced on his past with dealing with the other Lokis and planned to expose the truth about the TVA with everyone. Outside, Loki bonded with Sylvie and talked about their time together. 
[[File:Three Lokis watch Alioth destroy the USS Eldridge.jpg|{{AltFloat}}|The Lokis see [[Alioth]]]]
Though Sylvie worried about being alone, Loki assured her that they would take the [[TVA]] down, casting a blanket around them. Loki admitted his faults in the past to Sylvie, hoping to increase his trust with Sylvie. Having spent some more time, the group went to Alioth's location as the Lokis made their goodbyes with Loki and Sylvie while Mobius said his goodbyes returned to the [[Time Variance Authority Office]], hoping to persuade [[Ravonna Renslayer]].<ref name="LK105"/>

===[[Battle in the Void]]===
[[File:Come and get me! 2.png|{{AltFloat}}|[[Loki/New York Time Heist|Loki]] taunts [[Alioth]] with [[Laevateinn]]]]
As [[Loki/New York Time Heist|Loki]] and [[Sylvie Laufeydottir]] walked towards [[Alioth]], Alioth hovered towards them, howling at the two. Loki assured Sylvie before the two enacted their plan. Using the [[Laevateinn]], Loki distracted Alioth as Sylvie tried to enchant Alioth using one of its branches. However, Alioth turned to Sylvie and attempted to kill her. 
[[File:C517D159-213F-4817-BD13-10D75DF0DC17.jpeg|{{AltFloat}}|[[Classic Loki]] unleashes his illusions]]
Suddenly, Alioth was distracted by [[Classic Loki]], who created an illusion of [[Asgard]] in order to give Loki and Sylvie the chance to enchant Alioth. As Alioth tried to eat the illusion, Loki and Sylvie began enchanting the creature as the illusion began to fall apart. 
[[File:Journey Into Mystery 11.png|{{AltFloat}}|A rift opens to the [[Citadel at the End of Time]]]]
Unable to keep up the illusion, [[Classic Loki]], in a last effort to hold back Alioth, was killed. Alioth turned its attention back to Loki and Sylvie and tried to eat them, but the enchantment overtook Alioth. A rift then opened revealing the [[Citadel at the End of Time]] as Loki and Sylvie prepared themselves to find the [[He Who Remains|person]] who ruled over the [[TVA]].<ref name="LK105"/>

===Renslayer's Exile===
[[File:Ravonna's Fate.png|{{AltFloat}}|[[Ravonna Renslayer]] faces [[Alioth]]]]
During the [[Attack on the Time Variance Authority Office|attack]] on the [[Time Variance Authority Office|TVA office]], [[Ravonna Renslayer]] was pruned by [[Hunter X-05]] whilst he was being controlled by [[Sylvie Laufeydottir]] through [[Magic|enchantment]]. Renslayer was sent to the Void,<ref name="LK204">''[[Heart of the TVA|Loki: 2.04: Heart of the TVA]]''</ref> where she was immediately confronted by [[Alioth]].<ref name="LK206">''[[Glorious Purpose (Loki Season Two)|Loki: 2.06: Glorious Purpose]]</ref>

